{title: Hum Tumse Na Kuch Keh Paye}
{artist: Hariharan Chithra Ziddi}
{key: C#}

{c: Verse 1}
Hum [C#]Tumse na kuch kah pa [G#]ye,        Tum [C#]Humse na kuch kah paye
Hum [C#]Tumse na kuch kah pa [G#]ye,        Tum [C#]Humse na kuch kah paye
[C#]lagta hai dar ye [G#]bat ye dil ki,        [A#m]dil me na rah ja [C#]ye
Hum [C#]Tumse na kuch kah pa [G#]ye,        Tum [C#]Humse na kuch kah paye
Hum [C#]Tumse na kuch kah pa [G#]ye,        Tum [C#]Humse na kuch kah paye
Hum [C#]Tumse na kuch kah pa [G#]ye,        Tum [C#]Humse na kuch kah paye
[A#m]Tum suno [C#]gaur se,        [G#]Kya kah raha hain sa [C#]ma
[A#m]Humnashi [C#]chhed do,        [G#]Chahat bhari daas [C#]tan
[C#]kitne dino tak,        [G#]kuch na bataye
[A#m]Tum Humko tadpa [C#]ye,        Hum [C#]Tumse na kuch kah pa [G#]ye,
Tum [C#]Humse na kuch kah paye,        Hum [C#]Tumse na kuch kah pa [G#]ye,
Tum [C#]Humse na kuch kah paye,        [A#m]Pyar kya [C#]hai sanam
[G#]Tum Humko samjha ga [C#]ye,        [A#m]Faasle [C#]na rahe
[G#]itne karib aa ga [C#]ye,        [C#]Dekho Humari [G#]khusbu Tumhari
[A#m]sanso ko mahka [C#]ye,        Hum [C#]Tumse na kuch kah pa [G#]ye,
Tum [C#]Humse na kuch kah paye,        [A#m]raat bhar [C#]jaagkar
[G#]karwat badalte the [C#]hum,        [A#m]kya kahe [C#]kis tarah
[G#]dilbar machalte the [C#]hum,        [C#]Kaise bataye [G#]tanha akele
[A#m]Hum kitna ghabra [C#]ye,        Hum [C#]Tumse na kuch kah pa [G#]ye,
Tum [C#]Humse na kuch kah paye,        Hum [C#]Tumse na kuch kah pa [G#]ye,
Tum [C#]Humse na kuch kah paye,        [C#]lagta hai dar ye [G#]bat ye dil ki
[A#m]dil me na rah ja [C#]ye,        Hum [C#]Tumse na kuch kah pa [G#]ye,
Tum [C#]Humse na kuch kah paye
